  "name": "Find Kedim!",
  "short_name": "Find Kedim!",
  "description": "Find Kedim! by Zaib: pinch, zoom and tap to spot the hidden cats in busy hand drawn Malaysian scenes: a kampung, a beach, a KL street, a wet market and a mosque courtyard. Start with 10 easy cats and work up to 36 sneaky ones. Glowing hints, a sticker album and a timed mode. Free and kid-friendly, for ages 4 and up.",
